      <tr><td>Payment</td><td>Taking payment. We never see your full card number.</td><td>Stripe</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Course progress (lessons finished, quiz answers)</td><td>Showing your progress</td><td>PX1: your browser only. Other Ironwood Tech courses: our database.</td></tr>
