    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p><strong>What we never get.</strong> Anything you put into your own Claude account, calendar, Gmail, Notes or files while doing the lessons. That stays between you and those services, under their privacy terms.</p>

  <p><strong>What we don't do.</strong> We don't sell or rent your information, and we don't use it for ads. No tracking pixels.</p>

  <p><strong>Who we share with.</strong> Only the services that run the course (hosting, Stripe, email, AI provider), for that purpose, and anyone the law requires.</p>

  <p><strong>How long we keep it.</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Account and progress: while your account is open, plus 90 days.</li>
    <li>Payment and tax records: as long as tax law requires [about 7 years, VERIFY].</li>
    <li>Marketing list: until you unsubscribe.</li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Your choices.</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>Unsubscribe from marketing email anytime.</li>
    <li>Delete your account by emailing us.</li>
    <li>Ask to see, correct or delete your information at <%= mail_to "hello@kdfarmandgarden.com" %>. We answer within 30 days.</li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Age.</strong> For adults 18 and older. We don't knowingly collect information from children.</p>

  <p><strong>Security.</strong> We use reputable providers and limit access. No system is perfect. If a breach affects you, we'll tell you as the law requires.</p>

  <p><strong>Changes.</strong> We'll post updates here and email account holders about major changes.</p>
